== Rights of outgoing partners [Sec. 36] <36>

 An outgoing partner has the freedom to start a new business which compete with his previous firm.

But He Can't(by default):
- use previous firms name
- Represent himself as carrying on the business of the previous firm
- solicit with previous firms customers/persons who they were dealing with

/ solicit: means persuasion. It's synonyms are tempt/request/offer/hook/persuade, etc,.

